msgid "Manage static site deployment targets with type-specific workflows.\n\nEach site has a local directory and optional configuration keys (dir, rsync, etc.).\nSite types:\n  page (default)  — Ongoing page additions, rsync from site dir directly.\n  zine            — Zine-generated site, auto-builds before rsync, rsync from public/.\n\nSubcommands:\n  list                  List all configured sites\n  add    <name> ...     Add a new site with key=value pairs\n  update <name> <k> <v> Update a site's configuration key\n  remove <name>         Remove a site\n  optimize <name>       Optimize site CSS for responsive display\n  rsync  <name>         Deploy site via rsync (auto-builds zine, optimizes CSS)\n"
msgstr "Manage static site deployment targets with type-specific workflows.\n\nEach site has a local directory and optional configuration keys (dir, rsync, etc.).\nSite types:\n  page (default)  — Ongoing page additions, rsync from site dir directly.\n  zine            — Zine-generated site, auto-builds before rsync, rsync from public/.\n\nSubcommands:\n  list                  List all configured sites\n  add    <name> ...     Add a new site with key=value pairs\n  update <name> <k> <v> Update a site's configuration key\n  remove <name>         Remove a site\n  optimize <name>       Optimize site CSS for responsive display\n  rsync  <name>         Deploy site via rsync (auto-builds zine, optimizes CSS)\n"

msgid "Manage static site pages.\n\nEach page is a subdirectory under the site's directory containing an\nindex.html and its assets (images, etc.).\n\nSubcommands:\n  list    <site>            List all pages in a site\n  add     <site> <file>...  Add new pages from HTML/Org files\n  update  <site> <file>...  Update existing pages from HTML/Org files\n  remove  <site> <page>     Remove a page\n"
